      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        116.227783203125,
        395.3228454589844,
        129.57928466796875
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        135.96176147460938,
        513.41650390625,
        149.38226318359375
      ],
      "text": "Automated real-time nucleic acid amplification technology for rapid and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        149.76174926757812,
        513.41650390625,
        163.1822509765625
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous detection of tuberculosis and rifampicin resistance: Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        163.56173706054688,
        513.3820190429688,
        176.98223876953125
      ],
      "text": "system for the diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB in adults and children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        177.36172485351562,
        388.9519958496094,
        190.7822265625
      ],
      "text": "Policy Update.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        201.960205078125,
        207.1944122314453,
        215.58770751953125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 4 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        226.76568603515625,
        513.473876953125,
        240.3931884765625
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF should be used in preference to conventional microscopy and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        240.565673828125,
        513.4163818359375,
        254.19317626953125
      ],
      "text": "culture as the initial diagnostic test in testing cerebrospinal fluid specimens",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        254.36566162109375,
        363.8128967285156,
        267.9931640625
      ],
      "text": "from children suspected of having TB meningitis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        274.44464111328125,
        513.3935546875,
        287.796142578125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation given the urgency of rapid diagnosis, very low quality of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        288.24462890625,
        148.88941955566406,
        301.59613037109375
      ],
      "text": "evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941192626953,
        307.9786071777344,
        513.41650390625,
        321.39910888671875
      ],
      "text": "Automated real-time nucleic acid amplification technology for rapid and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941955566406,
        321.7785949707031,
        513.41650390625,
        335.1990966796875
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous detection of tuberculosis and rifampicin resistance: Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941955566406,
        335.5785827636719,
        513.3820190429688,
        348.99908447265625
      ],
      "text": "system for the diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB in adults and children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941955566406,
        349.3785705566406,
        388.9520263671875,
        362.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "Policy Update.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88941955566406,
        369.2505798339844,
        303.3343811035156,
        382.6020812988281
      ],
      "text": "Remarks for recommendations 3 and 4 :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18842315673828,
        394.05609130859375,
        510.265380859375,
        407.4075927734375
      ],
      "text": "a. \t Children suspected of having extrapulmonary TB but with a single Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        407.8560791015625,
        513.4511108398438,
        421.20758056640625
      ],
      "text": "RIF-negative result should undergo further diagnostic testing, and those with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        421.65606689453125,
        513.4279174804688,
        435.007568359375
      ],
      "text": "high clinical suspicion for TB should be treated even if an Xpert MTB/RIF result is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        435.4560546875,
        304.4039306640625,
        448.80755615234375
      ],
      "text": "negative or if the test is not available.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18842315673828,
        457.0875549316406,
        513.4166259765625,
        470.4390563964844
      ],
      "text": "b. \t For CSF specimens, Xpert MTB/RIF should be preferentially used over culture if",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        470.8875427246094,
        513.3936767578125,
        484.2390441894531
      ],
      "text": "the sample volume is low or additional specimens cannot be obtained, in order",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        484.6875305175781,
        510.2193908691406,
        498.0390319824219
      ],
      "text": "to reach quick diagnosis. If sufficient volume of material is available, concentra-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        498.4875183105469,
        348.33392333984375,
        511.8390197753906
      ],
      "text": "tion methods should be used to increase yield.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18842315673828,
        520.1190185546875,
        513.382080078125,
        533.4705200195312
      ],
      "text": "c. \t Pleural fluid is a suboptimal sample for the bacterial confirmation of pleural TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        533.9190063476562,
        513.4281005859375,
        547.2705078125
      ],
      "text": "using any method. A pleural biopsy is the preferred sample. The sensitivity of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        547.718994140625,
        510.1849670410156,
        561.0704956054688
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF in pleural fluid is very low. Nevertheless, any positive Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        561.5189819335938,
        513.405029296875,
        574.8704833984375
      ],
      "text": "RIF result based on pleural fluid should be treated for pleural TB, while those",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        575.3189697265625,
        469.08404541015625,
        588.6704711914062
      ],
      "text": "with a negative Xpert MTB/RIF result should be followed by other tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.18842315673828,
        596.9505004882812,
        513.4625244140625,
        610.302001953125
      ],
      "text": "d. \t These recommendations do not apply to stool, urine or blood, given the lack of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03642272949219,
        610.75048828125,
        400.9119873046875,
        624.1019897460938
      ],
      "text": "data on the utility of Xpert MTB/RIF on theses specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        635.9907836914062,
        383.6453857421875,
        652.8468017578125
      ],
      "text": "Interferon gamma-release assays (IGRAs)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.3944091796875,
        207.19239807128906,
        677.0219116210938
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 5 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        688.1998901367188,
        513.4141845703125,
        701.827392578125
      ],
      "text": "Interferon gamma-release assays (IGRAs) should not replace the tuberculin",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        701.9999389648438,
        510.18267822265625,
        715.62744140625
      ],
      "text": "skin test (TST) in low- and middle-income countries for the diagnosis of la-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        715.7999267578125,
        510.2403564453125,
        729.4274291992188
      ],
      "text": "tent TB infection in children or for the diagnostic work-up of children (irre-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        729.5999145507812,
        446.6453552246094,
        743.2274169921875
      ],
      "text": "spective of HIV status) suspected of TB disease in these settings",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        749.6788940429688,
        347.83740234375,
        763.0303955078125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
